    "title": "Blockade Definition & Meaning | Britannica Dictionary",
    "text": "The Britannica Dictionary mobile search Home Ask the Editor Word of the Day Quizzes Core Vocabulary Browse the Dictionary × Britannica Homepage Ask the Editor Word of the Day Quizzes Core Vocabulary Browse the Dictionary The Britannica Dictionary blockade 2 ENTRIES FOUND: blockade (noun) blockade (verb) 1 blockade /blɑˈkeɪd/ noun plural blockades 1 blockade /blɑˈkeɪd/ noun plural blockades Britannica Dictionary definition of BLOCKADE [count] : an act of war in which one country uses ships to stop people or supplies from entering or leaving another country a naval blockade [+] more examples [-] hide examples [+] Example sentences [-] Hide examples 2 blockade /blɑˈkeɪd/ verb blockades; blockaded; blockading 2 blockade /blɑˈkeɪd/ verb blockades; blockaded; blockading Britannica Dictionary definition of BLOCKADE [+ object] : to place a blockade on (a port or country) : to stop people or supplies from entering or leaving (a port or country) especially during a war They blockaded the country's ports. [+] more examples [-] hide examples [+] Example sentences [-] Hide examples ASK THE EDITOR Do I use 'has' or 'have' in this sentence: \"Al and Sue ('has' or 'have') purchased a new home\"? See the answer » QUIZZES Vocabulary Quiz Test your word power Take the Quiz » Name That Thing Take our visual quiz Test Your Knowledge » WORD OF THE DAY hyperactive : extremely active or too active Learn More » About Us & Legal Info Contact Us Privacy Notice Terms of Use Pronunciation Symbols Help d=\"M0 12c0 5.123 3.211 9.497 7.73 11.218-.11-.937-.227-2.482.025-3.566.217-.932 1.401-5.938 1.401-5.938s-.357-.715-.357-1.774c0-1.66.962-2.9 2.161-2.9 1.02 0 1.512.765 1.512 1.682 0 1.025-.653 2.557-.99 3.978-.281 1.189.597 2.159 1.769 2.159 2.123 0 3.756-2.239 3.756-5.471 0-2.861-2.056-4.86-4.991-4.86-3.398 0-5.393 2.549-5.393 5.184 0 1.027.395 2.127.889 2.726a.36.36 0 0 1 .083.343c-.091.378-.293 1.189-.332 1.355-.053.218-.173.265-.4.159-1.492-.694-2.424-2.875-2.424-4.627 0-3.769 2.